{"id":"77a064922629a30a","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-scott-rank.md","title":"ZFC Scott Rank","display":"df-zfc-scott-rank — ZFC Scott Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-scott-rank","aliases":["58-df-zfc-scott-rank"],"display":"df-zfc-scott-rank — ZFC Scott Rank","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-scott-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-scott-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-scott-rank — ZFC Scott Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,L,\\rho,E,\\eta\\in V\">\\(M,L,\\rho,E,\\eta\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(U=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_M=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}U^n\">\\(\\mathcal T_M=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}U^n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_M^{=}=\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^2:|\\bar a|=|\\bar b|\\}\">\\(\\mathcal T_M^{=}=\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^2:|\\bar a|=|\\bar b|\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtomicEq}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AtomicEq}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BackAndForthHierarchy}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{BackAndForthHierarchy}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (auxiliary predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScottRank}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ScottRank}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scott\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AtomicEq}_S(M,L,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\bar a,\\bar b\\in U^n\n\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},u_0,s_{\\bar a},s_{\\bar b}\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land u_0\\in U\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_{\\bar a})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_{\\bar b})\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s_{\\bar a}(x_i)=\\bar a(i)\\land s_{\\bar b}(x_i)=\\bar b(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\setminus n\\;(s_{\\bar a}(x_i)=u_0\\land s_{\\bar b}(x_i)=u_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i&lt;n\\}\n\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s_{\\bar a})\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s_{\\bar b})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scott\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AtomicEq}_S(M,L,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\bar a,\\bar b\\in U^n\n\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},u_0,s_{\\bar a},s_{\\bar b}\\in V\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land u_0\\in U\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_{\\bar a})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s_{\\bar b})\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s_{\\bar a}(x_i)=\\bar a(i)\\land s_{\\bar b}(x_i)=\\bar b(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\setminus n\\;(s_{\\bar a}(x_i)=u_0\\land s_{\\bar b}(x_i)=u_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i&lt;n\\}\n\\to\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s_{\\bar a})\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s_{\\bar b})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scott\\text{-}back\\text{-}and\\text{-}forth\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BackAndForthHierarchy}_S(E,\\eta,M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\eta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(E,\\eta\\cup\\{\\eta\\},\\mathcal P(\\mathcal T_M^{=})\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E(0)=\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^{=}:\\mathrm{AtomicEq}_S(M,L,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in(\\eta\\cup\\{\\eta\\})\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\xi\\;\\Biggl(\\xi=\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}\n\\land E(\\xi)=\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^{=}:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\forall c\\in U\\;\\exists d\\in U\\;\n\\langle\\bar a{}^\\frown\\langle c\\rangle,\\bar b{}^\\frown\\langle d\\rangle\\rangle\\in E(\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall d\\in U\\;\\exists c\\in U\\;\n\\langle\\bar a{}^\\frown\\langle c\\rangle,\\bar b{}^\\frown\\langle d\\rangle\\rangle\\in E(\\beta)\n\\Bigr\\}\\Biggr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\lor\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\xi)\n\\land E(\\xi)=\\bigcap_{\\beta\\in\\xi}E(\\beta)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scott\\text{-}back\\text{-}and\\text{-}forth\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BackAndForthHierarchy}_S(E,\\eta,M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\eta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(E,\\eta\\cup\\{\\eta\\},\\mathcal P(\\mathcal T_M^{=})\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E(0)=\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^{=}:\\mathrm{AtomicEq}_S(M,L,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in(\\eta\\cup\\{\\eta\\})\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\exists\\beta\\in\\xi\\;\\Biggl(\\xi=\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}\n\\land E(\\xi)=\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^{=}:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\forall c\\in U\\;\\exists d\\in U\\;\n\\langle\\bar a{}^\\frown\\langle c\\rangle,\\bar b{}^\\frown\\langle d\\rangle\\rangle\\in E(\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\forall d\\in U\\;\\exists c\\in U\\;\n\\langle\\bar a{}^\\frown\\langle c\\rangle,\\bar b{}^\\frown\\langle d\\rangle\\rangle\\in E(\\beta)\n\\Bigr\\}\\Biggr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\lor\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\xi)\n\\land E(\\xi)=\\bigcap_{\\beta\\in\\xi}E(\\beta)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scott\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScottRank}_S(\\rho,M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BackAndForthHierarchy}_S(E,\\rho+1,M,L)\n\\land E(\\rho)=E(\\rho+1)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\rho\\;(E(\\beta)\\neq E(\\beta+1))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scott\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScottRank}_S(\\rho,M,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BackAndForthHierarchy}_S(E,\\rho+1,M,L)\n\\land E(\\rho)=E(\\rho+1)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\rho\\;(E(\\beta)\\neq E(\\beta+1))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The entire hierarchy through <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho+1\">\\(\\rho+1\\)</span> is one set-coded function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>; the former family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv^{M,L}_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv^{M,L}_\\alpha\\)</span> is no longer a free metanotation.</li>\n<li>Atomic agreement is tied to a selected set-coded satisfaction recursion and explicit tuple assignments.</li>\n<li>Equality at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> together with strict change at every earlier stage states least stabilization without an off-by-one convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,L,\\rho,E,\\eta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_M=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}U^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_M^{=}=\\{\\langle\\bar a,\\bar b\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T_M^2:|\\bar a|=|\\bar b|\\}","display":f